  "posts": [
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Conservation is an essential part of a conservative worldview. Good discussion with local residents in Minster today about protecting Ohio\u2019s inland lakes.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050045250153202061",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-01T02:50:50+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Someone should ask my opponent Amy Acton the simple question this woman asked me: are you against boys competing in girls sports? Shouldn\u2019t be hard to answer.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050043632061964733",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-01T02:44:24+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The success of Ohio will include the success of every part of Ohio. Loved the optimism in Athens this week.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050036232210747720",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-01T02:15:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Love the energy. Keep it up, Mahoning County!\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050028366775079369",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-01T01:43:44+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Appreciate the men &amp; women who work hard behind the scenes to make our events possible. Thank you. \ud83d\ude4f\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2050015607010275471",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-01T00:53:02+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Great to be back to Darke County! Let\u2019s win this thing.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2049998929002205288",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-30T23:46:46+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Lower costs, bigger paychecks, better schools.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2049662525613215747",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-30T01:30:01+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Praying for this officer\u2019s recovery. Grateful to our men &amp; women in uniform who take risks every day to keep us safe. \ud83d\ude4f\n\n\nBrian Steel (@BrianSteel_)\n\nI was informed CPD Officer Shot in Linden Neighborhood.\n\nWill update when I can.\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/BrianSteel_/status/2049637620540477849#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2049644425643786749",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-30T00:18:06+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Incredible town hall today with carpenters, operating engineers, and other union workers in Richfield today. We\u2019re going to bring an economic boom to this state that lowers costs &amp; raises their paychecks.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2049644106868310136",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-30T00:16:50+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Sam Jones was a kickboxer who fought in Madison Square Garden back in 1975 &amp; he\u2019s still a living legend. Love the heroes we meet every day, from our big cities to Appalachia. \ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\udffc\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2049636484685463861",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-29T23:46:33+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We\u2019ll do everything possible to help small business owners like this entrepreneur in southeast Ohio. \ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\udffc\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2049634593456935307",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-29T23:39:02+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Met a proud father of a young Marine in Athens County last night. The best of our country, right here. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2049634202518466798",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-29T23:37:28+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I met Darlene in Athens County last night &amp; she turns 83 today. She\u2019s renovating the school &amp; community where she grew up, a true Ohio patriot. Happy birthday,\nDarlene! \ud83d\ude4c\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2049628653345296598",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-29T23:15:25+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Slash the tax burden. Cut the red tape. Bring high-paying jobs back to our state. Improve academic achievement in our public schools. Shouldn\u2019t be controversial, it\u2019s common sense.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2049626249165988251",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-29T23:05:52+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "This is what makes America exceptional in human history. It\u2019s called the American Dream for a reason.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2049613705986597088",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-29T22:16:02+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Our universities face a severe enrollment cliff, tuition is rising & the value of a college degree is declining. That\u2019s a brewing crisis. Real leaders don\u2019t hide from problems, we confront them. Enjoyed meeting the new President of Ohio State this morning & I look forward to working with university leaders across our state to understand where we excel & where we need to improve.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2049481687000547436",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-29T13:31:26+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Seniors are demanding property tax relief &amp; they\u2019re going to get it soon after I\u2019m sworn in. Enjoyed my third visit to Athens County, we\u2019ll never forget the great men &amp; women of southeast Ohio.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2049291673843404876",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-29T00:56:23+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Spending a lot of time in the Mahoning Valley &amp; we\u2019ll keep coming back all year. We\u2019re going to usher in an economic boom that this region hasn\u2019t seen in over half a century. \ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\udffc\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2049204004723565031",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-28T19:08:01+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffe\n\n\nAlex Triantafilou \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\ud83d\udc18\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 (@ChairmanAlex)\n\nOhio lost a giant of a man last week with the passing of former Senator Jim Carnes. Senator Carnes was a strong Republican and I was honored to get to know him and work with him as he was most recently on the State Central Committee of the Ohio GOP. God bless Jim Carnes for his dedication to his family, to Ohio, to his community, and to our Republican Party.  \n\nHere is just a snippet from his obituary:\n\n\u201cPerhaps most notably, Mr. Carnes worked to pro",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2049193234430308491",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-28T18:25:13+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
